        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Natural gas liquids, from natural gas, helium extraction</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Natural gas liquids, from natural gas, helium extraction
The multioutput-process "natural gas, helium extraction" of  delivers the co-products helium, natural gas liquids and sales gas. The allocation is based on mass calculation.;
UUID: a0a1fe26-5ad6-3a25-975e-986d4f12b7cc
Extraction of helium from natural gas including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world..
Technology: Helium extraction from natural gas
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a0a1fe26-5ad6-3a25-975e-986d4f12b7cc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
